WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.483
[crickets chirping]

00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:51.234
[alarm blaring]

00:00:51.318 --> 00:00:53.779
[panting]

00:01:00.369 --> 00:01:01.495
[elevator descending]

00:01:08.335 --> 00:01:09.628
[elevator dings]

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:16.802
[breathing heavily]

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.607
[low growling]

00:01:34.444 --> 00:01:36.071
[screaming]

00:01:43.745 --> 00:01:47.457
[Mike] Something is coming.
Something hungry for blood.

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:52.129
A shadow grows on the wall behind you,
swallowing you in darkness.

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:54.172
-It is almost here.
-What is it?

00:01:54.256 --> 00:01:55.590
What if it's the Demogorgon?

00:01:55.674 --> 00:01:58.718
Oh, Jesus, we're so screwed
if it's the Demogorgon.

00:01:58.802 --> 00:01:59.845
It's not the Demogorgon.

00:01:59.928 --> 00:02:02.180
An army of troglodytes
charge into the chamber!

00:02:02.264 --> 00:02:04.391
-Troglodytes?
-Told ya. [chuckling]

00:02:04.474 --> 00:02:06.268
-[snorts]
-[all chuckling]

00:02:07.853 --> 00:02:09.271
[softly] Wait a minute.

00:02:09.938 --> 00:02:11.898
Did you hear that?

00:02:11.982 --> 00:02:13.400
That... that sound?

00:02:13.483 --> 00:02:16.153
Boom... boom...

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.988
-[yells] Boom!
-[slams table]

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:19.948
That didn't come from the troglodytes.
No, that...

00:02:20.031 --> 00:02:21.700
That came from something else.

00:02:24.161 --> 00:02:26.163
-The Demogorgon!
-[all groaning]

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.706
-We're in deep shit.
-Will, your action!

00:02:27.789 --> 00:02:29.082
-I don't know!
-Fireball him!

00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:30.459
I'd have to roll a 13 or higher!

00:02:30.542 --> 00:02:32.377
Too risky.
Cast a protection spell.

00:02:32.461 --> 00:02:35.005
-Don't be a pussy. Fireball him!
-Cast Protection.

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.799
The Demogorgon is tired
of your silly human bickering!

00:02:37.883 --> 00:02:39.676
It stomps towards you.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:40.760
-Boom!
-Fireball him!

00:02:40.844 --> 00:02:43.138
-Another stomp, boom!
-Cast Protection.

00:02:43.221 --> 00:02:46.057
-He roars in anger!
-[all clamoring]

00:02:46.141 --> 00:02:47.642
-Fireball!
-[die clattering]

00:02:47.726 --> 00:02:49.352
-Oh, shit!
-[Lucas] Where'd it go?

00:02:49.436 --> 00:02:51.146
[Lucas] Where is it?
[Will] I don't know!

00:02:51.229 --> 00:02:52.772
-Is it a 13?
-[Will] I don't know!

00:02:52.856 --> 00:02:54.024
[Lucas] Where is it?
[Dustin] Oh, my God!

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:55.692
[Karen] Mike!
[Dustin] Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:56.860
[Karen] Mike!
[Lucas] Can you find it yet?

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.028
[Will] No, I can't find it!

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.779
-Mike!
-[Dustin] Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

00:02:59.863 --> 00:03:01.656
Mom, we're in the middle of a campaign!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.867
You mean the end?
Fifteen after.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.120
[Lucas] Oh, my God! Freaking idiot!
[Will] Why do we have to go?

00:03:07.245 --> 00:03:09.915
-Mom, wait, just 20 more minutes!
-It's a school night, Michael.

00:03:09.998 --> 00:03:12.459
I just put Holly to bed.
You can finish next weekend.

00:03:12.542 --> 00:03:14.085
-But that'll ruin the flow!
-Michael--

00:03:14.169 --> 00:03:15.420
I'm serious, Mom.

00:03:15.503 --> 00:03:17.964
The campaign took two weeks to plan.

00:03:18.048 --> 00:03:19.966
How was I supposed to know
it was gonna take ten hours?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.927
You've been playing for ten hours?

00:03:23.261 --> 00:03:27.057
-Dad, don't you think that 20 more--
-I think you should listen to your mother.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.602
-[static crackling on TV]
-[grunts] Dang dumb piece of junk.

00:03:31.645 --> 00:03:33.605
[Will] Oh, I got it!

00:03:33.688 --> 00:03:35.565
-Does the seven count?
-It was a seven?

00:03:36.233 --> 00:03:38.777
Did Mike see it?
Then it doesn't count.

00:03:43.406 --> 00:03:44.574
[Dustin] Yo, hey, guys.

00:03:44.658 --> 00:03:46.535
-Does anyone want this?
-[both] No.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.164
[Nancy] Yeah.

00:03:51.957 --> 00:03:53.542
No, I don't think...

00:03:54.668 --> 00:03:56.253
Yeah, he's cute.

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:59.673
Barb, no, I don't think so.

00:03:59.756 --> 00:04:01.216
-Barb, you're not--
-Hey, Nancy.

00:04:02.092 --> 00:04:03.468
There's a slice left if you want it.

00:04:03.552 --> 00:04:05.887
-Sausage and pepperoni!
-Hold on.

00:04:12.769 --> 00:04:16.690
-There's something wrong with your sister.
-What are you talking about?

00:04:16.773 --> 00:04:18.567
-She's got a stick up her butt.
-[Lucas] Yeah.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.152
It's because she's been dating
that douchebag, Steve Harrington.

00:04:21.236 --> 00:04:22.988
[Dustin] Yeah,
she's turning into a real jerk.

00:04:23.071 --> 00:04:24.406
She's always been a real jerk.

00:04:24.489 --> 00:04:26.366
Nuh-uh, she used to be cool.

00:04:26.449 --> 00:04:28.827
Like that time she dressed up as an elf
for our Elder tree campaign.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.120
[Mike] Four years ago!

00:04:30.245 --> 00:04:31.663
[Dustin] Just saying.
[Lucas] Later.

00:04:33.248 --> 00:04:35.292
-It was a seven.
-Huh?

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:37.127
The roll, it was a seven.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.422
The Demogorgon, it got me.

00:04:41.798 --> 00:04:43.466
[grunts] See you tomorrow.

00:04:59.107 --> 00:05:02.152
[Lucas] Good night, ladies.
[Dustin] Kiss your mom 'night for me.

00:05:03.486 --> 00:05:05.572
Race you back to my place?
Winner gets a comic.

00:05:05.655 --> 00:05:07.324
-Any comic?
-Yeah.

00:05:08.199 --> 00:05:10.327
[Dustin] Hey! Hey!

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.370
I didn't say "go"!

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:16.458
Get back here!

00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:18.668
I'm gonna kill you!

00:05:18.752 --> 00:05:21.171
[Will] I'll take your X-Men 134!

00:05:27.469 --> 00:05:29.012
Son of a bitch.

00:05:53.787 --> 00:05:54.829
[gasps]

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:58.458
[grunts]

00:05:59.667 --> 00:06:00.960
[whimpers]

00:06:04.339 --> 00:06:06.091
[indistinct growling]

00:06:07.092 --> 00:06:08.760
[gasps]

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:17.977
[Will panting]

00:06:23.191 --> 00:06:24.526
[dog barking]

00:06:28.071 --> 00:06:29.447
Mom?

00:06:29.531 --> 00:06:32.075
-Jonathan? Mom?
-[barking continues]

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:43.670
[indistinct screeching]

00:06:49.926 --> 00:06:51.302
[line ringing]

00:06:54.013 --> 00:06:56.724
-Hello? Hello?
-[static crackling]

00:06:56.808 --> 00:06:58.435
[indistinct screeching]

00:06:58.518 --> 00:06:59.853
[barking]

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:03.690
[whimpering]

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.401
[growling]

00:07:12.657 --> 00:07:15.160
-[dial tone]
-[barking continues]

00:07:28.965 --> 00:07:30.884
[panting]

00:07:47.692 --> 00:07:49.402
[breathing shakily]

00:07:56.034 --> 00:07:58.369
[growling]

00:08:00.413 --> 00:08:02.332
[indistinct screeching]

00:08:06.336 --> 00:08:08.296
[screeching intensifies]

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.593
[screeching stops]

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.232
[theme music playing]

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.115
[indistinct chatter on TV]

